WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.000
scores is a list of two numbers: place zero is you, place one is them.

2
00:00:05.727 --> 00:00:10.202
A win adds one at place zero. A loss adds one at place one.

3
00:00:11.082 --> 00:00:15.557
Your partner counts from its side: two one for you is one two for them.

4
00:00:18.127 --> 00:00:22.752
start round is a function, so the winner's micro:bit starts the next round.
